# Pharos additions -----------------------------------------------------------
#
# Build outputs and fetched runtimes. All of these are reproducible from the
# tracked sources, and together they are ~1.5 GB -- larger than everything this
# repository actually needs to carry.

# The packaged application (app/scripts/dir_build -p m).
app/staging/
# Packaged installers. build.sh writes a 180MB disk image here.
app/dist/

# The Gecko runtime, downloaded by app/scripts/fetch_xulrunner.
app/xulrunner/

# Submodule build outputs. The sources under reader/src, note-editor/src and
# document-worker/src are tracked; these are what js-build produces from them.
reader/build/
note-editor/build/
document-worker/build/

# pdf.js build output inside the vendored checkouts. The checkouts themselves
# are tracked -- they were git submodules upstream, and severing the submodules
# is what makes them ordinary source here.
reader/pdfjs/build/
document-worker/pdf.js/build/
